# 5. The Ghost Commerce layer is the real monster 🧠👻

The name "Ghost Commerce" fits perfectly because the machinery operates mostly behind the scenes.

The customer should never have to understand:

* supplier APIs
* inventory synchronization
* product normalization
* supplier scoring
* fulfillment routing
* price calculations
* margin calculations
* listing generation
* shipment synchronization

The system handles those.

Architecture:

```text
                    CUSTOMER
                       │
                       ▼
                AR / VR / WEB
                       │
                       ▼
                 GANJAGURU
                       │
                       ▼
              COMMERCE ORCHESTRATOR
                       │
