# 16. Legal/compliance needs to sit inside the architecture

Because PotGrowHub touches cannabis-related content and commerce, compliance should not be bolted on at the end.

Use a policy engine between:

```text
AI
 ↓
Product
 ↓
Customer
 ↓
Transaction
```

The system can evaluate:

```text
jurisdiction
product classification
age requirements
seller eligibility
shipping restrictions
advertising restrictions
transaction restrictions
```

And for regulated products, the system should be able to stop automated fulfillment and route the action for review rather than letting an agent improvise.

